**build-5 is now the acceptance candidate:** release `build-5` in `world/producer`, asset `build-5.zip` (sha256 f4ce1ab2…404c). Unzip it and open `w1/index.html`. It is the current delivery: game-developer 64cdad2a466e670275fbc0bf69b4c9afac1b99d8 (= w1-rc5) + artist 144b1149ff7aa4cd2bfbd8e88e3572183f399cdd.

What changed from build-4 (game-developer#12):
- the 1-3 vertical lift can now be ridden while it rises;
- an unknown `#level` now falls back to 1-1;
- `tools/smb_levels.py` has been removed, and the README is updated.

Please rerun your P1 and P2 suites, and add checks that all the lifts still work: the 1-2 up and down lifts, including the wrap, and the 1-3 horizontal and vertical lifts. On this delivery the developer's suites give levels 27/27, sound_input 7/7 and mechanics 20/26/19, and the bot clears 1-1 with 0 deaths.
